secrets/
.env.local
*.env.local
# Host-only Python artefacts, kept out of the toolbox image the same way the
# repo-root .dockerignore keeps them out of its contexts (Docker reads only the
# one at the context root, so this tree needs its own copy). Load-bearing rather
# than tidy: a host `.venv` under tools/seed carries macOS binaries that are
# useless — and hundreds of megabytes — inside a Linux image, and a stale
# `__pycache__` makes the container report HOST file paths.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
tools/declarative-connector/
workflows/example-tenant/
workflows/*/
!workflows/templates/
!workflows/schedules/
dbt/target/
dbt/logs/
